### Get all books
GET http://localhost:5000/api/books


### Create a book
POST http://localhost:5000/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Great Book",
  "author": "Author One",
  "translator": "Translator One",
  "category": "Literature",
  "language": "English",
  "year": 2020,
  "pages": 250,
  "summary": "This is a sample summary of the first book. Later this information will come from our database.",
  "description": "A sample literature book for testing our Digital Library.",
  "cover": null,
  "pdf": null
}   

### Get all books
GET http://localhost:5000/api/books


### Search by title
GET http://localhost:5000/api/books?search=Afghanistan


### Search by author
GET http://localhost:5000/api/books?search=Author%20Two


### Search by translator
GET http://localhost:5000/api/books?search=Translator%20Two

GET http://localhost:5000/api/books/6a917ca6eacf737d0e288508


### Register User
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "TestPassword123"
}

### Login User
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "TestPassword123"
}

### Wrong Password


